// The IR shadow (ir-design-2026-11.md §5.2, step I0): with the shadow armed, `emitFuncCode`
// hands each function here after its legacy lowering. The phase-A builder covers I1's set
// (constants, primitive ops, locals, `if`/loops/`break`/`continue`/`return`, direct calls and
// globals); any other construct leaves the function uncovered, a counted reason, not an error.
// A covered function is verified and then discarded: nothing is claimed, so no byte moves.
